[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/2359303187","html_url":"https://github.com/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/2563#issuecomment-2359303187","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/2563","id":2359303187,"node_id":"IC_kwDOA0JFE86MoBwT","user":{"login":"richardfontana","id":1179636,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExNzk2MzY=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1179636?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/richardfontana","html_url":"https://github.com/richardfontana","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/richardfontana/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/richardfontana/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/richardfontana/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/richardfontana/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/richardfontana/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/richardfontana/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/richardfontana/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/richardfontana/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/richardfontana/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-09-18T20:01:36Z","updated_at":"2024-09-18T20:01:36Z","body":"@jplesnik note also we will need a new issue at gitlab.com/fedora/legal/fedora-license-data. ","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/2359303187/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/2394461570","html_url":"https://github.com/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/2563#issuecomment-2394461570","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/2563","id":2394461570,"node_id":"IC_kwDOA0JFE86OuJWC","user":{"login":"jlovejoy","id":5048659,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUwNDg2NTk=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5048659?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy","html_url":"https://github.com/jlovejoy","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-10-04T19:44:29Z","updated_at":"2024-10-04T19:44:29Z","body":"for convenience here, the text for `any-OSI` is: \r\n\"Pick your favourite OSI approved license :)\r\nhttp://www.opensource.org/licenses/alphabetical\"\r\n\r\nI would say that the meaning here is roughly the same. Even though it lists a few licenses specifically, it then says, \"or any of the other OSI approved\r\nlicenses listed at http://www.opensource.org/licenses/alphabetical\"\r\n\r\nI'm not sure what to make of this addition: \"Distribution is allowed under all of these licenses, or any smaller subset of multiple or just one of these licenses.\"","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/2394461570/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/2427990744","html_url":"https://github.com/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/2563#issuecomment-2427990744","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/2563","id":2427990744,"node_id":"IC_kwDOA0JFE86QuDLY","user":{"login":"richardfontana","id":1179636,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExNzk2MzY=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1179636?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/richardfontana","html_url":"https://github.com/richardfontana","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/richardfontana/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/richardfontana/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/richardfontana/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/richardfontana/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/richardfontana/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/richardfontana/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/richardfontana/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/richardfontana/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/richardfontana/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-10-22T00:44:45Z","updated_at":"2024-10-22T00:47:43Z","body":"I don't think the meaning should be seen as the same (looking at the two license texts from an SPDX-legal sort of lens), for the following reasons: \r\n\r\n1. The original can be read it as saying \"Pick *one* OSI-approved license\". The new one gets rid of that ambiguity.\r\n2. The new one is more specific about what licenses are choosable: \"any of the . . .  OSI approved licenses listed at http://www.opensource.org/licenses/alphabetical\". This is arguably narrower than \"OSI-approved license\" since (I'm pretty sure) there are OSI-approved licenses that have been removed from the OSI website, or at least from being linked to at that URL (for example, certain deprecated licenses). \r\n3. The new one says \"Distribution is allowed under all of these licenses, or any smaller\r\nsubset of multiple or just one of these licenses.\" It is not clear that this is permitted under the old license -- this is the same issue as 1 (\"any OSI-approved license\" can be read as meaning \"one specific OSI-approved license\"). Mind you, I don't consider that the best reading but I think for SPDX to treat these two licenses as equivalent would be inconsistent with how SPDX has treated other similar or related licenses. \r\n\r\n \r\n","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/2427990744/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/2435748380","html_url":"https://github.com/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/2563#issuecomment-2435748380","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/2563","id":2435748380,"node_id":"IC_kwDOA0JFE86RLpIc","user":{"login":"swinslow","id":678569,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY3ODU2OQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/678569?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow","html_url":"https://github.com/swinslow","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/events{/privacy}","rece